<title>PORTUGAL: Ford Credit Europe launches 10 bln esc Navigator.</title>
<headline>Ford Credit Europe launches 10 bln esc Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Credit Europe is launching a 10 billion  escudo five-year Navigator at six-month Lisbor plus 10 basis points,  lead manager Banco Chemical Finance said.</p>
</text>
